I was setting up Ubuntu using the kernelnewbies wiki. The *link for Ubuntu 
12.04 (64 bit) *provided on the 
page https://kernelnewbies.org/OutreachyfirstpatchAlt?action=show&redirect=OPWfirstpatchAlt", 
